'''Shayzien armour''' is [[armour]] requiring 20 [[Defence]] to wear. Each tier grants slightly higher protection against the green acidic attack of [[Lizardman shaman|Lizardman shamans]]. In order to obtain Shayzien armour, players must compete in the [[Combat Ring (Shayzien)|Shayzien Combat Ring]] (20 defence required) within [[Shayzien]], or create it by [[Smithing]] [[lovakite bar]]s (11 bars for a full set). The [[collection log]] slots are filled regardless of how the armour is obtained. There are 5 different tiers of Shayzien armour:

*[[Shayzien armour (tier 1)]]
*[[Shayzien armour (tier 2)]]
*[[Shayzien armour (tier 3)]]
*[[Shayzien armour (tier 4)]]
*[[Shayzien armour (tier 5)]]
Shayzien armour can be stored in the [[armour case]] of a [[costume room]]. [[Ironman Mode|Ultimate Ironmen]] will be unable to retrieve individual pieces until the full set is stored.

